    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steve and Kyle's Adventures is a conditional turn based (CTB) RPG game. This game follows the character Steve who is trying to take his script to the theatre in Hamford and Kyle who is trying to collect legendary weapons. They meet up to 6 other characters including Elaina who believes she is in a Video Game. You can mine, craft, and customize your weapons and armor with runes. With 2 optional guilds and 3 optional superbosses the game can potentially have over 30 hours of gameplay.</p>",
